function roman(n){const m=['I','II','III','IV','V','VI','VII','VIII','IX','X','XI','XII','XIII','XIV','XV','XVI','XVII','XVIII','XIX','XX','XXI','XXII','XXIII','XXIV','XXV','XXVI','XXVII','XXVIII'];return m[n-1]}
function renderQuestion(){
  const q=questions[current]; $('#chapter').textContent=q[0]; $('#roman').textContent=roman(current+1); $('#question').textContent=q[1];
  $('#progressText').textContent=String(current+1).padStart(2,'0')+' / 28'; $('#progressBar').style.width=((current+1)/28*100)+'%'; $('#backBtn').style.opacity=current?'1':'.35';
  $('#options').innerHTML=''; q[2].forEach((o,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='option'+(answers[current]===i?' selected':'');b.innerHTML=`<b>${String.fromCharCode(65+i)}</b><span>${o[0]}</span>`;b.onclick=()=>choose(i,o[1],b);$('#options').appendChild(b)});
}
function choose(index,trait,button){
  document.querySelectorAll('.option').forEach(x=>x.disabled=true); button.classList.add('selected');
  if(answers[current]!==undefined){scores[questions[current][2][answers[current]][1]]--} answers[current]=index;scores[trait]++;
  setTimeout(()=>{if(current<questions.length-1){current++;renderQuestion()}else finish()},280);
}
function pickTop(group){return group.reduce((a,b)=>scores[b]>scores[a]?b:a)}
function finish(){show('ritual');setTimeout(renderResult,1900)}
function renderResult(){
  const a=pickTop(primary),b=pickTop(secondary),career=careers[a+'|'+b];
  $('#portrait').src='assets/cards/'+career.image;$('#portrait').alt=career.name+'塔罗牌人物画像';$('#careerName').textContent=career.name;$('#careerEn').textContent=career.en;$('#declaration').textContent='“'+career.declaration+'”';$('#careerIntro').textContent=career.intro;$('#soul').textContent=career.soul;$('#blessing').textContent=career.blessing;
  const max1=Math.max(...primary.map(x=>scores[x])),max2=Math.max(...secondary.map(x=>scores[x]));
  $('#traits').innerHTML=[[a,scores[a],14,max1],[b,scores[b],14,max2]].map(([t,v,total])=>`<div class="trait"><div class="trait-head"><strong>${t}</strong><span>${traitCopy[t]} · ${Math.round(v/total*100)}%</span></div><div class="trait-bar"><i data-width="${Math.max(18,v/total*100)}%"></i></div></div>`).join('');
  $('#tarot').classList.remove('flipped');$('#analysis').className='analysis hidden';show('result');
}
function flip(){if($('#tarot').classList.contains('flipped'))return;$('#tarot').classList.add('flipped');$('.flip-hint').textContent='命运已经回应你的选择';setTimeout(()=>{$('#analysis').className='analysis visible';document.querySelectorAll('.trait-bar i').forEach(x=>x.style.width=x.dataset.width)},850)}
$('#startBtn').onclick=()=>{current=0;answers=[];Object.keys(scores).forEach(k=>scores[k]=0);renderQuestion();show('quiz')};
$('#backBtn').onclick=()=>{if(!current)return;const old=questions[current][2][answers[current]];if(old){scores[old[1]]--;answers[current]=undefined}current--;renderQuestion()};
$('#tarot').onclick=flip;$('#tarot').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();flip()}};
$('#restartBtn').onclick=()=>show('landing');
$('#saveBtn').onclick=()=>window.print();
